SUMMARY:PILF Cornhole Tournament Fundraiser
DESCRIPTION:The Public Interest Law Foundation (PILF) is hosting a cornho
 le tournament to raise funds for public interest internship summer salari
 es! The tournament will be on the law school lawn from 4:30-6:30 pm on Th
 ursday\, November 19! Contestants must make a minimum $5 donation and com
 plete the registration form to participate.  Contestants will compete in 
 groups of two. Each contestant must complete the registration form by 12:
 00pm ET on Wednesday\, November 18. If you have already picked a teammate
 \, you can add their name. If you select a teammate after completing this
  form\, please email iupilf@iu.edu (mailto:iupilf@iu.edu) with both names
 . If you don't have a partner by the deadline\, one will be assigned to y
 ou.  On November 19\, contestants will have to show confirmation of their
  donation and complete a waiver when they sign in for the event.Register 
 and donate using the links below!Registration Form:https://forms.gle/UszR
