 ternship summer salaries! The tournament will be on the law school lawn f
 rom 4:30-6:30 pm on <strong>Thursday\, November 19</strong>! Contestants 
 must make a minimum $5 donation and complete the registration form to par
 ticipate.</p><p>  Contestants will compete in groups of two. <strong>Each
  contestant must complete the registration form by 12:00pm ET on Wednesda
 y\, November 18</strong>. If you have already picked a teammate\, you can
